{"v":4,"catch":"將你的靈魂伴侶從福爾圖娜手中拯救出來。","desc":"德雷爾·克勞利的成長經歷很艱難：他失去了父母，最後進了孤兒院。 \n隨著德雷爾年齡的增長，他決定結束無盡的厄運並恢復家族的聲譽。 \n但有一個問題：德雷爾不走運。 \n絕望之下，他決定與福爾圖娜做一筆交易：用無限的幸運換取愛心。 \n貝阿特麗斯和弗朗茨是德雷葉的下一個目標。 \n解決棘手的謎題，智取惡棍的追隨者，並拯救愛情鳥。 \n\n現在比賽開始了！","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2024-01-25","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d26d388ca3c1b9f4140ad9f2ac8bad81cd38a025c05753dd76bf68ed6d015055.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee6cb7066002560422c0184b9a98ca5e39b1d93b6f440330729b5745e08647fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba3e5181af3bbc8905b1d0260edb6154b0600b9a8da64cfa372a91e56d4b102b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5ad5319238c38c7ce10a080332eeca1a884bc2f68c884fe92afd0f5c12afb41e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4bdae4e7d8983d848d035398034b8663bda5910688e0df7064893a02c8a9f56a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f09709e5f557b6568442f001bbce1855c47dae2bee6f3c3e8860559cefb39fc5.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e5201d372000","dlc":[]}